    <title>Slices of Brownian Sheet: New Results, and Open Problems</title>
    <updated>2005-10-24T22:54:48Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0510518v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/0510518v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>  We can view Brownian sheet as a sequence of interacting Brownian motions or slices. Here we present a number of results about the slices of the sheet. A common feature of our results is that they exhibit phase transition. In addition, a number of open problems are presented.</summary>
